## Download and Getting Started

1. Visit the GitHub Releases page.
2. Download the SplineStudio ZIP package.
3. Extract the archive to a folder of your choice.
4. Launch SplineStudio.exe.
5. Complete the initial setup.

No installation is required.

[Download Spline Studio](https://github.com/OMSI2Merzoa/OMSI-SplineStudio/releases)

## Automatic Updates

Spline Studio can check for new versions through GitHub Releases.

Stable and beta update channels are supported. To receive pre-release versions, enable the option to include beta updates in the application settings.

## Development Status

Spline Studio is currently being prepared for its first official release.

Development is focused on stability, usability improvements, and compatibility verification.

Pre-release versions may contain bugs. Please maintain backups of important projects and data.

